  "bodyHash": "oPWIxGeptms=",
  "content": "<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:36px\"><strong>探索模組</strong></span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:24px\">為遊戲增添更多原版風格的建築結構</span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><br><img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/v31Shw5/divider-red.png\" alt=\"分隔線\" width=\"1903\" height=\"10\"></p><p style=\"text-align:center\">本模組支援 Forge 和 Fabric（自 1.18.2 版本起）。請查看檔案頁面以獲取所有模組版本。</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\">Fabric 版本需要 Fabric API </span> <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/fabric-api\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">點此獲取</a></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><br><img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/v31Shw5/divider-red.png\" alt=\"分隔線\" width=\"1903\" height=\"10\"></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:24px\">目前已新增的結構：</span></p><table>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"text-align:center;font-size:18px\"><strong>遺忘之井</strong></td>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n<td style=\"text-align:center;font-size:18px\"><strong>叢林神廟</strong></td>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n<td style=\"text-align:center;font-size:18px\"><strong>神社</strong></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/cLxYjbk/forgotten-well.png\" alt=\"遺忘之井\" width=\"250\" height=\"250\"></td>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n<td><img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/tY40Ttq/jungle-temple.png\" alt=\"叢林神廟\" width=\"250\" height=\"250\"></td>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n<td><img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/5xKMs5S/shrine.png\" alt=\"神社\" width=\"250\" height=\"250\"></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"text-align:center;font-size:18px\"><strong>地下神廟</strong></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/0cKmPqp/underground-temple.png\" alt=\"地下神廟\" width=\"250\" height=\"250\"></td>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n<td><img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/3SLhq9h/underground-temple-2.png\" alt=\"地下神廟\" width=\"250\" height=\"250\"></td>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n<td><img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/3CfqXrz/underground-temple-3.png\" alt=\"地下神廟\" width=\"250\" height=\"250\"></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"text-align:center;font-size:18px\"><strong>浮空島</strong></td>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n<td style=\"text-align:center;font-size:18px\"><strong>巨型橡樹</strong></td>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n<td style=\"text-align:center;font-size:18px\"><strong>原木堆</strong></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/LYMX3kg/floating-island.png\" alt=\"浮空島\" width=\"250\" height=\"250\"></td>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n<td><img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/9c8YJKD/large-oak-tree.png\" alt=\"巨型橡樹\" width=\"250\" height=\"250\"></td>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n<td><img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/chKJKLd/logs.png\" alt=\"原木堆\" width=\"250\" height=\"250\"></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"text-align:center;font-size:18px\"><strong>沙漠遺跡</strong></td>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n<td style=\"text-align:center;font-size:18px\"><strong>史萊姆洞穴</strong></td>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/wKZ2wnL/desert-ruin.gif\" alt=\"沙漠遺跡\" width=\"250\" height=\"250\"></td>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n<td style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/X8BWG6Z/slime-cave-raw-left.png\" alt=\"史萊姆洞穴左側\" width=\"250\" height=\"250\"></td>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n<td style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/YLssKsf/slime-cave-raw-right.png\" alt=\"史萊姆洞穴右側\" width=\"250\" height=\"250\"></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table><p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/v31Shw5/divider-red.png\" alt=\"分隔線\" width=\"1903\" height=\"10\"></p><p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"font-size:18px\">官方資料包：</span></p><ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/no-more-floating-islands\" rel=\"nofollow\">NoMoreFloatingIslands</a> =&gt; 防止浮空島生成</li>\n</ul><p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/v31Shw5/divider-red.png\" alt=\"分隔線\" width=\"1903\" height=\"10\"></p><p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;<span style=\"font-size:18px\">若對本模組有任何疑問，或想了解即將推出的功能：</span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\">歡迎加入我的&nbsp; &nbsp;<a href=\"https://discord.gg/bhUaWhq\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/VQ66pHN/Discord.png\" alt=\"Discord\" width=\"166\" height=\"32\"></a>&nbsp; &nbsp;<a href=\"https://discord.gg/bhUaWhq\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">連結</a> </span></p>",
